    <h2 class="section-title">What Ed Stands For</h2>
    <div class="section-divider"></div>

    <div class="priorities-grid">

      <div class="priority-card">
        <div class="priority-icon">
          <!-- Child/student icon -->
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2a4 4 0 1 0 0 8 4 4 0 0 0 0-8z"/><path d="M20 21v-1a8 8 0 0 0-16 0v1"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Make Students Priority #1</h3>
        <p>Every policy decision begins with one question: is this best for Chicago's kids? Ed is committed to keeping students at the center of every board vote, resource allocation, and school improvement plan.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="priority-card">
        <div class="priority-icon">
