        <p>Chicago families deserve to know how their school funding is spent. Ed will fight for full budget transparency, rigorous financial oversight, and real accountability for principals and administrators.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="priority-card">
        <div class="priority-icon">
          <!-- People/staffing icon -->
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M3 21v-2a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h4a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v2"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/><path d="M21 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Fight for Staffing & Resources</h3>
        <p>Our schools need qualified teachers, counselors, and support staff to help every student succeed. Ed will advocate relentlessly for the staffing levels and classroom resources Northwest Side schools deserve.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="priority-card">
        <div class="priority-icon">
          <!-- Book/education icon -->
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"/><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"/></svg>
